R-05 SESSION REVOCATION — FIRESTORE EMULATOR EVIDENCE
Date: 2026-10-20
Repository: /home/ubuntu/repos/cpmwall3
Project: demo-cpm (Firestore Emulator at 127.0.0.1:8080)
Fixed harness: 127.0.0.1:4177
Baseline commit: 4157bc2, harness 127.0.0.1:4178

The emulator was reused; Admin SDK test fixtures and server writes bypass
Firestore Security Rules. Harness credentials and JWT secret are throwaway.
Throwaway test passwords and bearer JWTs are redacted below; decoded token
payloads are retained to show session identifiers and compatibility behavior.
All requests and responses below are from the emulator/local harness only.

